    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Process one file** (called by Discover, Reconcile and Approve Mapping)\nClaims the event, downloads the file from Drive, sends it to the processor, which parses/validates/loads it in ONE transaction and marks it processed only after the commit.\nUnknown or changed layouts are held (needs_mapping) and a redacted mapping proposal is saved and announced for approval - nothing is guessed. Other files that need a person are announced once by *Discover* (\"Check Attention\").",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 560
      },
